## Isolation levels (coupling limits)

One agent task = **one layer owner**. Crossing layers without milestone `Depends on` is a boundary violation (`boundaries.mdc`).

| Level | Path | Owns | Must not own |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| L0 Contract | `api/openapi/`, Go `*_handlers.go` | Query params, DTO, validation, SQL/CH | `web/src` pages (unless milestone section 7 closes both) |
| L1 Transport | `web/src/helpers/*_api.ts` | HTTP, abort, parse JSON to typed snapshot | `useMemo` filter/sort over full `items[]` |
| L2 Composition | `web/src/pages/*` | Section compose, URL → fetch params, route entry | `*.module.css`, business rules, invented API fields |
| L3 Domain UI | `web/src/ui/<domain>/` | Grid, chips, dropdown open state, CSS modules | Cross-page Context, server logic |
| L4 Shared chrome | `web/src/ui/shell/`, `web/src/ui/system/` | Nav, login, PageChrome, tokens consumers | Domain-specific API shapes |
| L5 Tokens | `web/src/styles/tokens.css` | Design tokens (`rem`, semantic colors) | Component layout |
| L6 Static embed | `web/src/static/` | `track.js` snippet (not admin) | Admin React imports |

### Hard FE/BE boundary

| Concern | Server | Browser |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Filter, search, sort | Query params + handler | Pass params; render `items` |
| Pagination, totals | `limit`, `offset`, `total` | Controls only |
| Labels, money | `*_label`, `*_display`, micros | Map tone enum; format display fields |
| Validation | 400 + field map | Show API errors |
| Export / long jobs | Async endpoint + poll | Job id + poll UI |

Forbidden: React Context for list filter state; root `FilterProvider`; client KPI math; hand-written TS types diverging from OpenAPI.

## Target package map

```
web/src/
  pages/                 # compose only; <= ~120 lines; no *.module.css
  ui/
    <domain>/            # one folder per admin domain (customers, campaigns, billing, …)
      *.tsx
      *.module.css
      *.variants.ts        # CVA + cn()
    shell/               # login, nav, layout chrome
    system/              # Button, ErrorBlock, DataGrid primitives
  helpers/
    <domain>_api.ts      # fetch + parse only
    use_resource.ts      # shared fetch hook (not domain logic)
  types/
    generated/openapi.d.ts
    index.ts             # thin re-exports only
  lib/
    cn.ts
  styles/
    tokens.css           # tokens only in new work; legacy global CSS sunsets
  static/
    track.js
```

### Banned trees and patterns

| Pattern | Why | Replacement |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `web/src/dto/`, `usecase/`, `providers/` | Ceremony hides contracts | `helpers/` + `ui/<domain>/` |
| `web/src/models/` with business rules | Duplicate server logic | Delete on migrate; server DTO only |
| `web/src/components/` monolith | No domain boundary | Split into `ui/<domain>/` + `ui/system/` |
| Page imports `*.module.css` | CSS ownership leak | `check_ui_surface_gate.sh` |
| BEM `__` under `ui/` | Unscoped global classes | CSS Modules + CVA |
| Global `btn--*` on pages | Layout escape | `<Button>` from `ui/system/` |
| Product-prefixed static (`ad-event-processor-track.js`) | Legacy token | `track.js`, export `trackEvent` (`naming.mdc`) |

## Domain module shape (exemplar)

One admin domain = one `ui/<domain>/` folder + one `helpers/<domain>_api.ts` + one or more thin `pages/*`.

```
ui/customers/
  customers_directory.tsx       # section: toolbar + grid + footer
  customers_directory.module.css
  customers_grid.tsx
  customers_grid.module.css
  customers_grid.variants.ts

helpers/customers_api.ts

pages/customers_page.tsx        # <CustomersDirectory /> + useResource + URL params
```

Rules:

- Section owns CSS Grid template (`ui.mdc` Layout).
- Page never formats rows; grid receives pre-labeled fields from API.
- Variants in `*.variants.ts`; `cn()` string-only in hot row loops (`react.mdc` DoD / hot render path).

List/grid performance (DoD, prefetch, GC): `react.mdc`.

## Migration from legacy tree

| Legacy | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| `web/src/components/*` | Move to `ui/system/` or `ui/<domain>/`; delete when unused |
| `web/src/models/*` | Remove; use OpenAPI types + server fields |
| `web/src/styles/*.css` (non-token) | Inline into domain CSS modules; keep shrinking globals |
| Client `sortRows` / `filter` in pages | Replace with server query params + refetch |
| `<table>` data grids | `role="grid"` + subgrid (`ui.mdc`) |

Ship order: `admin_contract_gate` → `admin_shell` → `admin_directory_pattern` for first list page → replicate pattern.

